#. Translators: Long description for this add-on shown in NVDA's Add-ons Store and Add-ons Manager.
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Harness the power of Google's state-of-the-art Gemini AI for high-quality "
"speech generation directly within NVDA. This add-on provides a user-friendly "
"dialog to convert text into natural-sounding audio.\n"
"\n"
"Key Features:\n"
"- High-Quality Voices: Choose Gemini Flash-Lite 3.8 TTS for everyday "
"narration or Gemini Flash 3.8 TTS for expressive dialogue. Previous Gemini "
"3.1 and 2.5 TTS models remain available.\n"
"- Single and Multi-Speaker Modes: Easily generate audio for a single speaker "
"or create dynamic dialogues with two distinct speakers. Simply format your "
"text with \"SpeakerName:\" to assign voices.\n"
"- Advanced Voice Control: Fine-tune the output by adjusting the temperature "
"for more creative or stable results, and provide custom style instructions.\n"
"- Quick Speak: Speak selected text or clipboard text immediately with "
"separate model, voice, and style settings while keeping focus in the current "
"application.\n"
"- Seamless Workflow: The add-on provides instant audio playback upon "
"generation and allows you to save the resulting .wav file for later use.\n"
"\n"
"To get started, obtain a Gemini API key from Google AI Studio and enter it "
"in the add-on's settings panel, found under NVDA's Tools menu."
msgstr ""
"Nutzen Sie Googles hochmoderne Gemini-KI für hochwertige Spracherzeugung "
"direkt in NVDA. Dieses Add-on bietet einen benutzerfreundlichen Dialog, der "
"Text in natürlich klingendes Audio umwandelt.\n"
"\n"
"Hauptfunktionen:\n"
"- Hochwertige Stimmen: Wählen Sie Gemini Flash 3.1 Preview für "
"leistungsstarke kurze Audios mit geringer Latenz, Gemini Flash 2.5 für "
"schnelle Erzeugung in Standardqualität oder Gemini Pro 2.5 für hochwertige, "
"lebensechte Sprache.\n"
"- Einzel- und Mehrsprechermodus: Erzeugen Sie Audio für einen Sprecher oder "
"dynamische Dialoge mit zwei verschiedenen Stimmen. Formatieren Sie den Text "
"einfach mit \"Sprechername:\", um Stimmen zuzuweisen.\n"
"- Erweiterte Stimmsteuerung: Passen Sie die Temperatur für kreativere oder "
"stabilere Ergebnisse an und geben Sie eigene Stilanweisungen an.\n"
"- Quick Speak: Sprechen Sie ausgewählten Text oder Text aus der "
"Zwischenablage sofort mit separaten Modell-, Stimmen- und Stileinstellungen, "
"ohne den Fokus der aktuellen Anwendung zu verlassen.\n"
"- Zugängliche Benutzeroberfläche: Alle Steuerelemente sind vollständig "
"zugänglich, einschließlich eines einklappbaren Bereichs für erweiterte "
"Einstellungen.\n"
"- Nahtloser Arbeitsablauf: Das Add-on gibt erzeugtes Audio sofort wieder und "
"ermöglicht das Speichern der WAV-Datei zur späteren Verwendung.\n"
"\n"
"Besorgen Sie sich zunächst einen Gemini-API-Schlüssel bei Google AI Studio "
"und tragen Sie ihn in den Add-on-Einstellungen im NVDA-Menü Extras ein."

#. Translators: Short release notes shown for this add-on version.
msgid ""
"- Tested with NVDA 2026.3.\n"
"- Fixed Voice Library caching, voice creation, and dialog closing issues, "
"and updated the Indonesian translation.\n"
"- Added Voice Remix to create a new voice by describing changes to an "
"existing voice in Voice Library.\n"
"- Grouped Voice Design and Voice Replication under New voice with "
"descriptions.\n"
"- Added Voice Replication with reference and consent WAV uploads, consent "
"verification, and a paid-tier notice.\n"
"- Clarified that Voice Design requires an API key from a project with "
"billing enabled.\n"
"- Added Voice Design to create custom voices from descriptions in Voice "
"Library.\n"
"- Added Gender, Pitch, Persona, and Use case filters to Voice Library.\n"
"- Fixed existing samples for extended voice IDs such as en-us-fola and en-us-"
"rami.\n"
"- Native Speech Generation stage 2: Added a searchable Voice Library with "
"type and language filters, 70 verified voice samples and explicitly "
"generated previews with editable text, cached catalogs, and saved narrator/"
"speaker voices for Gemini 3.8 TTS.\n"
"- Native Speech Generation stage 1: Added Gemini 3.8 Flash-Lite and Flash "
"TTS, structured style and speaker metadata, script validation, and Script "
"Help.\n"
"- Added Gemini 3.8 Live for Quick Speak and Talk with AI, and Gemini 3.8 "
"Live Extended Thinking for Talk with AI.\n"
"- Applied model-specific thinking settings while preserving existing model "
"preferences.\n"
"- Fixed interrupted WebSocket reads, permanent API error handling, reconnect "
"status, and keyboard focus preservation.\n"
"- See changelog.md for full details.\n"
msgstr ""

